## Status

Self-excluded: **no verified public benchmark numbers** were found for the exact model/ID `muse-spark-1.2` in accessible sources at time of research.

## Research notes

- Verified metadata from accessible sources (not benchmark scores): Artificial Analysis lists Muse Spark 1.2 (Xhigh) as a deprecated proprietary reasoning model (released 2026-08-05) with 1M-token context, text/image/speech/video input and text output, pricing ~$1.25/$4.25 per 1M input/output tokens, TTFT ~7.87s and output speed ~192 tok/s (Meta API context). OpenRouter lists `meta/muse-spark-1.2` with provider routing/pricing and capabilities.
- Artificial Analysis reported the Intelligence Index and task-level benchmark aggregates as unavailable/N/A for this model in the fetched snapshot; no standalone verified benchmark scores (e.g. GPQA, SWE-bench, HLE, Terminal-Bench, MMMU, etc.) for this exact model/ID were found in accessible sources.
- Project aliases note that Muse Spark 1.2 covers all Muse Spark 1.2 tier names (one model, same weights; tiers differ by price/data-use). This exclusion applies to the `muse-spark-1.2` model identity due to lack of verifiable benchmark evidence, not a tier split.
- Per `model-report-TEMPLATE.md`: if zero verified public benchmark numbers are found for the exact model/ID, save a notes-only `.md.excluded` file and do not invent placeholder scores.

